        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nskinparam classAttributeIconSize 0\nskinparam monochrome true\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam linetype ortho\n\nclass Users {\n  + user_id: int\n  + full_name: string\n  + phone: string\n  + role: UserRole\n  --\n  + register(): void\n  + updateProfile(): void\n}\n\nclass Operator {\n  + operator_id: int\n  + license_no: string\n  + is_eligible: boolean\n  + hourly_rate: float\n  --\n  + checkEligibility(): boolean\n  + assignBooking(): void\n}\n\nclass Machine {\n  + machine_id: int\n  + name: string\n  + type: string\n  + hourly_rate: float\n  + status: MachineStatus\n  --\n  + register(): void\n  + setMaintenanceStatus(): void\n}\n\nclass Maintenance {\n  + maintenance_id: int\n  + start_time: DateTime\n  + end_time: DateTime\n  + status: MaintenanceStatus\n  --\n  + create(): void\n  + complete(): void\n}\n\nclass Booking {\n  + booking_id: int\n  + start_time: DateTime\n  + end_time: DateTime\n  + total_fee: float\n  + status: BookingStatus\n  + booking_time: DateTime\n  --\n  + validateConditions(): void\n  + calculateFee(): void\n  + complete(): void\n}\n\nclass Handover {\n  + handover_id: int\n  + handover_time: DateTime\n  + machine_condition: string\n  + type: HandoverType\n  --\n  + generateReport(): string\n}\n\n&#39; --- RELATIONSHIPS ---\n\n&#39; Operator kế thừa Users (Mũi tên tam giác rỗng chĩa lên Users)\nUsers &lt;|-- Operator\n\n&#39; Chủ máy (Users) sở hữu Machine\nUsers \&quot;1\&quot; &lt;-- \&quot;0..*\&quot; Machine : owns\n\n&#39; Nông dân (Users) tạo Booking\nUsers \&quot;1\&quot; &lt;-- \&quot;0..*\&quot; Booking : creates\n\n&#39; Operator nhận Booking\nOperator \&quot;0..1\&quot; &lt;-- \&quot;0..*\&quot; Booking : operates\n\n&#39; Machine chứa Maintenance (Aggregation: Hình thoi rỗng nằm phía Machine)\nMachine o-- \&quot;0..*\&quot; Maintenance\n\n&#39; Machine được thuê trong Booking\nMachine \&quot;1\&quot; &lt;-- \&quot;0..*\&quot; Booking\n\n&#39; Booking chứa Handover (Composition: Hình thoi đặc nằm phía Booking)\nBooking *-- \&quot;1..2\&quot; Handover\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="rdqRUEM5xTK2KOK2k5a2-0">
